  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project funds will be used to provide finance and business development services to previous USADF grantees. CRGT was created to provide the funding to the missing middle of agricultural finance; for farmers associations with a track record of successful business; but minimal credit history and access commercial lending.</narrative>
